[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/2208179189","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7365#issuecomment-2208179189","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7365","id":2208179189,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAacf886DniP1","user":{"login":"arjan-bal","id":46515553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE1NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46515553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal","html_url":"https://github.com/arjan-bal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-04T06:03:18Z","updated_at":"2024-07-04T06:03:18Z","body":"There is roughly 0.4% flakiness when run on forge: 399 out of 100000 failures","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/2208179189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/2208197021","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7365#issuecomment-2208197021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7365","id":2208197021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAacf886Dnmmd","user":{"login":"arjan-bal","id":46515553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE1NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46515553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal","html_url":"https://github.com/arjan-bal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-04T06:19:39Z","updated_at":"2024-07-04T07:39:11Z","body":"## Investigation\r\nIt looks like the subchannel picks the same address twice in case of failures\r\n```\r\ntlogger.go:116: INFO clientconn.go:1329 [core] [Channel #522 SubChannel #523]Subchannel picks a new address \"127.0.0.1:44757\" to connect  (t=+1.285688ms)\r\ntlogger.go:116: INFO clientconn.go:1329 [core] [Channel #522 SubChannel #523]Subchannel picks a new address \"127.0.0.1:44757\" to connect  (t=+1.429717ms)\r\n```\r\n\r\ntryAllAddrs is being called twice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/2208197021/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/2208258873","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7365#issuecomment-2208258873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/7365","id":2208258873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAacf886Dn1s5","user":{"login":"arjan-bal","id":46515553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE1NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46515553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal","html_url":"https://github.com/arjan-bal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arjan-bal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-04T07:02:02Z","updated_at":"2024-07-04T12:19:10Z","body":"## Root Cause\r\n* Balancer Wrapper calls connect in a new go routine: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blame/bdd707e642e40cf75db5ac3f0f6af48077f48368/balancer_wrapper.go#L276C22-L276C22\r\n* This in turn calls addrConn.connect() which briefly locks the mutex, ensures the channel is idle releases the mutex before calling resetTransport here: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/bdd707e642e40cf75db5ac3f0f6af48077f48368/clientconn.go#L914-L925\r\n* resetTransport locks the mutex when it starts, it also sets the state to connecting to prevent parallel connections: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/bdd707e642e40cf75db5ac3f0f6af48077f48368/clientconn.go#L1234-L1262\r\n\r\nWhen addrConn.connect releases the mutex after checking for idleness, another call to  addrConn.connect can come in which also sees the channel as idle because resetTransport hasn't acquired the lock yet. So we have two connection attempts in parallel.\r\n\r\nA simple fix it to set the state to connecting while addrConn.connect has the mutex locked. I tried it and it fixed the flakiness. Will discuss with the team and raise a PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/2208258873/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]